  "description": "The Snowplow payload records a page view (event\u202f=\u202fpage_view) on the product_page of our site at\u202fhttps://www.example.com/products/abc123. The user identifier is\u202fuser-12345, coming from IP\u202f203.0.113.42 with a device ID\u202fdevice-98765 and a fingerprint\u202ff2d5c8e9a7b3c1d4e6f8a0b2c4d6e8f0. The request was made with the browser string\u202fMozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/115.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 on a Windows\u202fx64 machine (system\u202f=\u202fWindows, architecture\u202f=\u202fx64, locale\u202f=\u202fen-US) using Google Chrome\u202f115.0.0.0. The session cookie is\u202fsessionId=abcde12345; path=/; HttpOnly, and the session ID is\u202fsession-abc123. The page was served from the host\u202fMySite (https://www.example.com) with a referrer\u202fhttps://www.google.com/ and the path\u202f/products/abc123, marked as active (status\u202f=\u202factive) and recorded at\u202f2023-10-12T14:23:45Z (device time\u202f2023-10-12T14:23:45.123Z). The transaction identifier is\u202ftransaction-001, containing item\u202fitem-789 (\u201cSuper\u202fWidget\u201d) priced at\u202f49.99\u202fUSD, quantity\u202f1, with the overall order\u202forder-555 marked as completed and a total of\u202f49.99\u202fUSD (currency\u202f=\u202fUSD). The advertising campaign associated with this view is\u202fcampaign-2023-summer from advertiser\u202fadvertiser-5678.\n\nTechnical details show the client\u2019s screen resolution\u202f1920x1080 (device\u202fue_na) with a pixel density\u202f96\u202fdpi, a JavaScript version\u202f1.0, and a color depth of\u202f0. The page content type is\u202ftext/html, character sets UTF\u20118 (both content\u2011type and charset), and the document encoding is UTF\u20118. The viewport is\u202f1280x720, while the primary display supports a maximum of\u202f1920x1080, a medium size of\u202f1280x720, a minimum of\u202f800x600, and a lowest\u2011height size of\u202f600x400. The user agent reports a desktop platform (ds\u202f=\u202fdesktop) in the America/New_York time zone (tz) with language\u202fen-US. Feature flags indicate Adobe Flash\u202ftrue, PDF\u202ftrue, RealPlayer\u202ftrue, and all other plug\u2011ins (directx, fla, gears, java, qt, wma)\u202ffalse. The MAC address recorded is\u202f00:1A:2B:3C:4D:5E, and a video element with ID\u202fvideo-001 was present, rendered at\u202f1280x720.",
